{"unit_id": "tag:01H9:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本文定义概形（schemes）。\n一项基础参考文献是<REF_0001>。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "本文所定义的数学对象"}], "notes": []}
