t_term": "概形", "context": "其上配有环层的对象"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "概形上不由空间内在性质决定的层"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间", "context": "这里指概形的底层空间"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "用来构造谱的环"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱", "context": "配备环层后作为基本构件的空间"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引环的谱所在的篇名"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "由该环构造并配在谱上的层"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "谱上的环层在各点处的对象"}, {"source_term": "primes", "target_term": "素理想", "context": "环中用来取局部环的素理想"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "与谱上环层的茎对应的环"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间", "context": "这里说明引入它的两个理由"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱", "context": "第一条理由中连续映射所涉及的空间"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续", "context": "谱之间映射的性质"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "谱之间给定的连续映射"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "与这些谱对应的环"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "不能一般地由谱之间的连续映射指定的环之间的映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "另外加入的映射数据"}, {"source_term": "ringed spaces", "target_term": "环化空间", "context": "这里考察谱的态射时所在范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "这里考察谱的态射的环境"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱", "context": "第二条理由中考察其态射的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "在环化空间范畴中考察的箭头"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "第二条理由中考察诱导映射的层对象"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "未必为局部同态的茎上映射"}, {"source_term": "homomorphisms", "target_term": "同态", "context": "茎上诱导的映射未必满足的局部同态条件"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间", "context": "接下来引入的空间类型"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01HB:statement", "translation": "局部环化空间（Locally ringed spaces）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001>局部环化空间（locally ringed space）<MATH_0001><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是一个二元组（pair），由拓扑空间（topological space）<MATH_0002>和环层（sheaf of rings）<MATH_0003>组成，且后者的所有茎（stalks）都是局部环（local rings）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 给定局部环化空间（locally ringed space）<MATH_0004>，我们称<MATH_0005>为<TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0006>在（at）<MATH_0007>处的局部环（local ring）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。\n我们用<MATH_0008>（或简写为<MATH_0009>）表示<MATH_0010>的极大理想（ideal）。\n此外，<TEXTITOPEN_0003><MATH_0011>在（at）<MATH_0012>处的剩余域（residue field）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>是剩余域（residue field）<MATH_0013>。\n<STRUCT_0004> <TEXTITOPEN_0004>局部环化空间的态射（morphism of locally ringed spaces）<TEXTITCLOSE_0004><MATH_0014>是满足下述条件的环化空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）。对所有<MATH_0015>，诱导的环映射（ring map）<MATH_0016>都是局部环（local ring）映射（map）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部环化空间"}, {"source_term": "at", "target_term": "在"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "at", "target_term": "在"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"source_term": "morphism of locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism of ringed spaces", "target_term": "环化空间的态射"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间", "context": "定义标题所指的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部环化空间", "context": "此处由拓扑空间和满足条件的环层定义的对象"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组", "context": "由拓扑空间和环层组成的数据"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "二元组的第一个组成部分"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "二元组的第二个组成部分"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "对这些对象逐一施加局部环条件"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "定义中对环层各茎的要求"}, {"source_term": "locally ringed space", "target_term": "局部环化空间", "context": "接下来记述局部环的给定空间"}, {"source_term": "at", "target_term": "在", "context": "术语库存所列的局部环取点用语"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "给定空间在指定点处的环"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "给定局部环的极大理想"}, {"source_term": "at", "target_term": "在", "context": "术语库存所列的剩余域取点用语"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域", "context": "给定空间在指定点处的域"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域", "context": "用于标识该域的局部环剩余域"}, {"source_term": "morphism of locally ringed spaces", "target_term": "局部环化空间的态射", "context": "此处通过茎上条件定义的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism of ringed spaces", "target_term": "环化空间的态射", "context": "满足额外条件的底层态射"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "在茎上诱导的映射"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "术语库存所列的局部环映射的组成词"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "术语库存所列的局部环映射的组成词"}], "notes": []}
